    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:08:45",
      "utterance": "あー、どうでしょう、物音ですぐ起きたりもしてしまうので",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:08:54",
      "utterance": "眠りは浅いかなと、思ってます",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:09:16",
      "utterance": "なるほど、、食欲とかはいかがですか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:09:26",
      "utterance": "食欲は普通ですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:09:40",
      "utterance": "良かったです！",
      "tag": "Affirmation"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:09:47",
      "utterance": "他に体調とかで",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:10:02",
      "utterance": "気になること、とかございませんか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:10:30",
      "utterance": "疲れているせいなのか、だるいです、全体的に",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:10:53",
      "utterance": "了解しました、眠り浅いこととかも影響あるかもですね",
      "tag": "Inform"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:10:55",
      "utterance": "あー、疲れたなーと思っている時間は多いと思います",
      "distress_level": 2,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:11:03",
      "utterance": "なるほど、、",
      "tag": "Backchannel"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:11:51",
      "utterance": "体調良い時と比べ明らかに、違うようなら、一度お医者様に診て頂くとも必要かもですね",
      "tag": "Suggest"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:05",
      "utterance": "なるほど",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:07",
      "utterance": "そうですね",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:15",
      "utterance": "はい、、それで、、",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:24",
      "utterance": "旦那様のことですが、、",
      "tag": "Other"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:28",
      "utterance": "はい",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 0
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:12:54",
      "utterance": "いつぐらいから、今のように顔色を伺うようになりましたか？",
      "tag": "OpenQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:13:16",
      "utterance": "多分、付き合ってる頃からそうだったんだろうなーと思ってます",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 2
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:13:52",
      "utterance": "なるほど、、年数にすると、どれくらいな感じですか？",
      "tag": "ClosedQuestion"
    },
    {
      "role": "client",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:14:18",
      "utterance": "12年ぐらいですかね、付き合ってた頃から、今までで",
      "distress_level": 1,
      "disclosure_depth": 1
    },
    {
      "role": "counselor",
      "time": "2020-08-04T21:14:56",
      "utterance": "なるほど、、かなり長い間、気を使われてる感じなのですね・・・",
